"product in the <strong>Sales</strong> app and assigning the <strong>\"Create "
"Membership\"</strong> action to it. Whether it's a regular product or a\n"
"                subscription, any partner who purchases this product will "
"automatically become a member and receive the corresponding pricelist."
msgstr ""
